/span><span begin="00:46.500" end="00:46.740">on </span><span begin="00:46.740" end="00:47.730">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.000" end="00:49.500"><span begin="00:48.000" end="00:48.270">And </span><span begin="00:48.270" end="00:48.420">oh</span><span begin="00:48.420" end="00:48.420">, </span><span begin="00:48.420" end="00:48.630">what </span><span begin="00:48.630" end="00:48.930">else </span><span begin="00:48.930" end="00:49.140">can </span><span begin="00:49.140" end="00:49.230">I </span><span begin="00:49.230" end="00:49.500">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.500" end="00:55.110"><span begin="00:49.500" end="00:51.030">You </span><span begin="00:51.030" end="00:52.800"> </span><span begin="00:52.800" end="00:53.220">say </span><span begin="00:53.220" end="00:53.460">that </span><span begin="00:53.460" end="00:53.700">you're </span><span begin="00:53.700" end="00:54.030">not </span><span begin="00:54.030" end="00:55.020">around</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.110" end="00:58.980"><span begin="00:55.110" end="00:55.290">And </span><span begin="00:55.290" end="00:55.680">you </span><span begin="00:55.680" end="00:55.980">don't </span><span begin="00:55.980" end="00:56.340">wanna </span><span begin="00:56.340" end="00:56.550">be </span><span begin="00:56.550" end="00:58.680">found</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.980" end="01:02.580"><span begin="00:58.980" end="00:59.700">Well</span><span begin="00:59.700" end="00:59.730">, </span><span begin="00:59.730" end="01:00.270">I </span><span begin="01:00.270" end="01:00.510">wanna </span><span begin="01:00.510" end="01:00.630">be </span><span begin="01:00.630" end="01:00.720">the </span><span begin="01:00.720" end="01:01.260">best </span><span begin="01:01.260" end="01:01.350">at </span><span begin="01:01.350" end="01:01.620">what </span><span begin="01:01.620" end="01:01.680">I </span><span begin="01:01.680" end="01:02.340">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.580" end