9.320">the </span><span begin="01:19.320" end="01:20.310">covers </span><span begin="01:20.310" end="01:20.370"> </span><span begin="01:20.370" end="01:20.970">right </span><span begin="01:20.970" end="01:21.360">up </span><span begin="01:21.360" end="01:21.390"> </span><span begin="01:21.390" end="01:21.900">over </span><span begin="01:21.900" end="01:22.530">your </span><span begin="01:22.530" end="01:23.430">head</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.460" end="01:25.320"><span begin="01:23.460" end="01:23.832">You're </span><span begin="01:23.832" end="01:24.204">in </span><span begin="01:24.204" end="01:24.576">my </span><span begin="01:24.576" end="01:24.948">head</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.320" end="01:29.610"><span begin="01:25.320" end="01:25.590">It </span><span begin="01:25.590" end="01:26.040">won't </span><span begin="01:26.040" end="01:26.730">always </span><span begin="01:26.730" end="01:26.970">be </span><span begin="01:26.970" end="01:27.420">like </span><span begin="01:27.420" end="01:28.260">this</span><span begin="01:28.260" end="01:28.260">, </span><span begin="01:28.260" end="01:28.320">be </span><span begin="01:28.320" end="01:28.410">like </span><span begin="01:28.410" end="01:29.280"> </span><span begin="01:29.280" end="01:29.610">this</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.610" end="01:32.790"><span begin="01:29.610" end="01:29.760">I'm </span><span begin="01:29.760" end="01:30.840">dead</span><span begin="01:30.840" end="01:30.870">, </span><span begin="01:30.870" end="01:31.230">honey</span><span begin="01:31.230" end="01:31.230">, </span><span begin="01:31.230" end="01:31.440">I'll </span><span begin="01:31.440" end="01:31.590">be </span><span begin="01:31.590" end="01:32.700">dead</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.790" end="01:52.650"><span begin="01:32.790" end="01:33.060">It </span><span begin="01:33.060" end="01:33.630">won't </span><span begin="01:33.630" end="01:34.230">always </span><span begin="01:34.230"